Description: COSMIC compositor (cosmic-comp), from the cosmic-epoch monorepo
 The Wayland compositor of the System76 COSMIC Desktop Environment, built
 from the cosmic-comp submodule pinned by cosmic-epoch. Packaged separately
 from cosmic-epoch-monorepo so compositor fixes can be rebuilt and installed
 on their own.
